The ultimate war between magic and science is about to begin.

2
00:08:20,869 --> 00:08:26,869
The Flight of Dragons is a animation, fantasy,
family film directed by Jules Bass.

3
00:12:31,304 --> 00:12:37,304
The realm of magic is being threatened by the realm of logic, so the
green wizard, Carolinus, decides to shield it for all time.

4
00:16:41,739 --> 00:16:47,739
Ommadon, the evil red wizard, stands in his way.

5
00:20:52,173 --> 00:20:58,173
Carolinus then calls for a quest that is to be led by a man named Peter
Dickinson, who is the first man of both the realms of science and magic.

6
